<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0650_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Misty</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Could you repeat that? I can’t hear\nyou at ALL. Connection trash, I guess.\rMove along and call again! Not that I\nwant you to. Whatever.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi...\nOh, hi. What’s happenin’?\fEverything good with me.\fI wasn’t waitin’ for you to call.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We both know there’s way stronger\nBlock Bosses around, right?\fYou better be ready to work hard.\fI ain’t sayin’ it ’cause I care.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but I got a lot goin’ on...\nI’m busy lately...\rWell, Wednesday mornings I got some\nfree time. Try callin’ then?\fOr don’t. I don’t care. Call though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh hi, I’m free today!\nNot that I was waitin’.\fLet’s scrap again, OK? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK! So, I’ll see you at the Saffron\nDojo, then!\fI ain’t excited. I’m normal.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aw...\nThat make me sad...\fI mean. Whatever. I’m fine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t sure... You only makin’ plans\nwith me?\rDidn’t you make plans with somebody\nelse already?\fNot that I’m jealous. I’m not.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\fIf you stand me up, I’m finna be sad.\fI mean MAD. I said mad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, this Misty...\nHi, how you doin’?\fNot that I care.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We made plans to meet at the Saffron\nDojo.\rYou remember you meetin’ me?\nI been lookin’ forward to this...\fNOT a lot. A normal amount.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you been through all of Kanto?\nHow is it, compared to Johto?\fThere’s a lotta beautiful views here,\fright?\rI ESPECIALLY love the Cape off\nRoute 25!\rI got SO many memories along that\ncoast...\rWhat kinda memories? Pfft!\nLike I’d tell you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That reminds me...\nThat weirdo who came through my Block\frecently...\rThat was you who beat him and ran him\noff, wasn’t it?\rI forgot to say good looks!\rEverybody in my Block deadass\nappreciate it. Good looks fr!\fDon’t make it weird.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0650_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you heard?\nIf you beat all six people on Route 25\fwithout losin’, you get a true-love\fwish!\rYou ain’t hear about that?\nFr?\rWell, that’s ’cause I just made it up!\nHa ha ha! You believed it!</language>
	</row>
</body>
